{"id":"n88648-1-18","stage":0,"title":"앞 · 前","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88648-1-18-1","ko":"일 끝나고 회사 앞에서 만나.","zh":"工作结束后，在公司门口见吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일","meaning":"事，工作","explanation":"일：事，工作","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"5","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝나고","meaning":"下课，下班","explanation":"끝나다：下课，下班；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞에서","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나.","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"需要解决或处理的问题或事项。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"下课，下班","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"在学校或公司等地方做完当天的功课或业务。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞"